NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — eco-avalanche (ha) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.303
<v Narrator>Na farko, a cikin rayuwa da kuma lissafi, hankali yana tashi ta hanyar mataki na tara ta hanyar ratchet na alamu guda.

2
00:00:09.383 --> 00:00:21.471
<v Narrator>Na biyu, AI na yau da kullum yana tsayawa a mataki na biyar, amfani da kayan aiki, saboda ayyukan yau da kullun suna sa ido kan manyan samfuran daga farko.

3
00:00:21.551 --> 00:00:33.090
<v Narrator>Na uku, yin nazarin amsoshin da aka tabbatar a cikin maganganun bincike na ƙarancin ƙarfi ya wuce wannan bango kuma ya buɗe matakai huɗu masu girma.
